<title>PHILIPPINES: PSBank 1996 Q4 net up at 164.282 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PSBank 1996 Q4 net up at 164.282 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		     (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Interest Income	     566.983 vs 380.741</p>
<p>    Net income		    164.282 vs 102.540</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine Savings Bank. The bank is a unit of Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co Inc.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
